{"channelId":"UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","row":["Joe Tatta, PT, DPT",4960,"Dr. Joe Tatta is a leader in integrative pain care. He serves as the CEO of the Integrative Pain Science Institute. He is also an adjunct professor in the Arcadia University DPT program. He has published peer-reviewed articles and 3 books on pain management. His professional accomplishments extend to the creation of scalable practice models grounded in health behavior change and innovative approaches empowering physical therapists to assume the role of primary healthcare providers. He is passionate about implementation science and strategies that facilitate the uptake of evidence-based practice into regular use by practitioners. The culmination of his work is PRISM: Pain Recovery and Integrative Systems Model – a cognitive behavioral approach for physical therapy. Learn more at: integrativepainscienceinstitute.com.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:24.437Z","channelId":"UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"76654a1409a29883c4b426f27c52bb4fd7795c7f23df648acbd6e5e3e2bd64ee","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"2bf37cd5f879bfe300b48d9283c0fada1c8feb2a919de8287916a9872562d2b4"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:24.437Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4960,"raw":"4.96K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVaGWn6aLEFH_SPcYEgFM9A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:24.437Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLeve